- **Gaps**: What operations or workflows are NOT covered
- **Integration patterns**: How this tool works with other tools for multi-step workflows

**AI-Specific Considerations:**
This skill/tool will be used by an AI employee. When investigating existing capabilities, note:
- Which existing tool operations are fully autonomous vs. require human confirmation
- How error handling and retry logic works in existing integrations
