## Executive Summary

This research synthesizes findings from the FinOps Foundation's anomaly management framework, Atlassian's internal cost anomaly detection implementations, and multiple internal RFCs on robust statistical methods (MAD, rolling medians, seasonality handling). The findings are directly applicable to designing the `ml-cost-stewardship` SKILL's anomaly detection logic.

