# Tarot v3 Model Registry: Research Findings

## 1. Overview & Identity

**What it is**: Tarot v3 (also called "ML Registry v3" or simply "the Registry") is Atlassian's internal ML artifact and metadata store. It replaced the legacy Tarot v2 API (SageMaker-centric, single tar.gz per version) with a general-purpose, multi-component registry designed to store any ML/AI asset type — models, prompts, datasets, modules, SageMaker packages, etc. — with rich governance, lineage, and compliance integration.

**Key distinction**: "Tarot" is the service name; "ML Registry" is the product name. V2 is being deprecated (removal date: June 30, 2026). V3 is the current and future API.

**Sources**: 
- [Deprecating Model Registry V2 API: Transition to ML Registry V3 API](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/MLP/blog/2026/03/20/6650530784)
- [Nandini x Riteka Brain Dump](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/~7120203d1d05da1ecb49d1a4596a19bb96d37b/pages/6635061712)
- [CMK Assessment: Tarot (ML Registry Service)](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/entcap/pages/6054216041)

---

## 2. Core Data Model (Hierarchy)

The v3 data model follows a strict hierarchy:

```
Namespace → Component (typed, with owner) → Version (immutable group of artifacts) → Artifacts (individual files)
```

###2.1 Namespace
- Organizational grouping (like a folder/team boundary)
- Contains other namespaces (tree/DAG structure) and components
- Has owner (AD group) and permissions
- Example: `search-relevance`, `confluence-ai-summary-snippets`

### 2.2 Component
- Has a unique UUID `id`
- Has a `type` field: `model`, `prompt`, `dataset`, `sagemaker-package`, `tarot-v2`, `module`
- Has an `owner` (AD group)
- Has fine-grained permissions (write, read, deploy)
- Can be referenced by UUID or by fully-qualified namespace path (e.g., `search-relevance.qi_query_classification_models.doctype_query_intent`)
- Immutable data classification declared at creation (for UGC models)

### 2.3 Version
- Auto-incremented integer ID, unique within a component
- Represents a specific state/collection of artifacts
- Immutable once created
- Can have labels (e.g., `approved`, `release`)
- Can have tags (mutable named references) and aliases (immutable named references)
- Has metadata (structured JSON)
- Created via: `POST /api/v3/components/{ref}/versions`

### 2.4 Artifact
- Individual file stored in the registry
- Has unique ID, filename, size, hash
- Stored in S3 (legacy) or TDP Object Store (UGC)
- Immutable once uploaded
- Has data classification + attribution labels
- Uploaded via two-step protocol

### 2.5 Tags vs Aliases

| Property | Tag | Alias |
|----------|-----|-------|
| Format | Short string | `@[a-zA-Z0-9_.-]{1,64}` |
| Mutable | Yes – can be moved | No – locked forever |
| Multiple per version | Yes | Yes |
| Use case | Datasets, prompts, `latest` | Deployments, releases, auditing |
| Example | `latest`, `experiment-7` | `@feb-2026`, `@experiment-42` |

**Source**: [ML Registry for TEAMserve's workflows](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/AO2/pages/6763958763)

---

## 3. API Endpoints (Register / Query / Promote)

### 3.1 Namespace Endpoints
| Operation | Endpoint | Method |
|-----------|----------|--------|
| Create namespace | `/api/v3/namespaces` | POST |
| Get namespace | `/api/v3/namespaces/{namespace_ref}` | GET |
| Update namespace | `/api/v3/namespaces/{namespace_ref}` | PUT |
| Delete namespace | `/api/v3/namespaces/{namespace_ref}` | DELETE |
| Get namespace permissions | `/api/v3/namespaces/{namespace_ref}/permissions` | GET |
| Set namespace permissions | `/api/v3/namespaces/{namespace_ref}/permissions` | PUT |
| Add namespace item | `/api/v3/namespaces/{namespace_ref}/items` | POST |
| List namespace items | `/api/v3/namespaces/{namespace_ref}/items` | GET |
| Remove namespace item | `/api/v3/namespaces/{namespace_ref}/items` | DELETE |

### 3.2 Component Endpoints
| Operation | Endpoint | Method |
|-----------|----------|--------|
| Create component | `/api/v3/components` | POST |
| Get component | `/api/v3/components/{component_ref}` | GET |
| List components | `/api/v3/components` | GET |
| Update component | `/api/v3/components/{component_ref}` | PUT |
| Delete component | `/api/v3/components/{component_ref}` | DELETE |
| Get component permissions | `/api/v3/components/{component_ref}/permissions` | GET |
| Set component permissions | `/api/v3/components/{component_ref}/permissions` | PUT |
| Patch component permissions | `/api/v3/components/{component_ref}/permissions` | PATCH |

**Create Component Request Example:**
```json
{
  "name": "search.relevance.ranker.UiEvents",
  "description": "UI events data set",
  "type": "dataset",
  "owner": {"group": "search-ad-group-name"}
}
```

**Response:**
```json
{
  "id": "2f3c8a0b-8c95-4f2a-bb4a-3e5c41c8f1b0",
  "name": "search.relevance.ranker.UiEvents",
  "owner": {"group": "search-ad-group-name"},
  "type": "dataset",
  "links": {
    "self": "/api/v3/components/2f3c8a0b-...",
    "uploads": "/api/v3/components/2f3c8a0b-.../uploads",
    "versions": "/api/v3/components/2f3c8a0b-.../versions",
    "artifacts": "/api/v3/components/2f3c8a0b-.../artifacts",
    "tags": "/api/v3/components/2f3c8a0b-.../tags"
  }
}
```

**Source**: [DataSet component type - design](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/MLP/pages/5627424846), [Component Specs](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/MLP/pages/4629793961)

### 3.3 Artifact Upload (Two-Step Protocol)
| Operation | Endpoint | Method |
|-----------|----------|--------|
| Init upload | `POST /api/v3/components/{ref}/uploads` | POST |
| Put bytes | `PUT /api/v3/components/{ref}/uploads/{uploadId}` | PUT |
| List artifacts | `GET /api/v3/components/{component_ref}/artifacts` | GET |
| Get artifact | `GET /api/v3/components/{component_ref}/artifacts/{artifact_id}` | GET |
| Download artifact | `GET /api/v3/components/{component_ref}/artifacts/{artifact_id}/download` | GET |

**Upload flow:**
1. `POST /api/v3/components/{ref}/uploads` — declares data-classification + attribution; returns `uploadId`
2. `PUT /api/v3/components/{ref}/uploads/{uploadId}` — streams artifact bytes (one file per upload)

**Headers for upload**: `X-Filename: prompt.json`, `Content-Type: application/json` (or `application/octet-stream`)

**Source**: [Tarot Model Ingress Paths](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/~712020f42e6ad0a6ee44319b956587ec99b127/pages/6974673626)

### 3.4 Version Endpoints
| Operation | Endpoint | Method |
|-----------|----------|--------|
| Create version | `POST /api/v3/components/{component_ref}/versions` | POST |
| Get version | `GET /api/v3/components/{component_ref}/versions/{version_ref}` | GET |
| List versions | `GET /api/v3/components/{component_ref}/versions` | GET |
| Update version | `PUT /api/v3/components/{component_ref}/versions/{version_ref}` | PUT |
| Delete version | `DELETE /api/v3/components/{component_ref}/versions/{version_ref}` | DELETE |

**Create Version Request Example:**
```json
{
  "description": "Initial version",
  "artifacts": ["artifact-uuid-1", "artifact-uuid-2"],
  "labels": ["approved"],
  "metadata": {
    "type": "dataset",
    "dataset-id": "190BBF11-DFA8-45D4-ADC1-FD5151AABE8B",
    "schema": [
      {"name": "prTitle", "type": "string", "tag": "UGC/Label"},
      {"name": "sourceCommit", "type": "string", "tag": "None"}
    ]
  }
}
```

**Source**: [DataSet component type - design](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/MLP/pages/5627424846)

### 3.5 Tag Endpoints
| Operation | Endpoint | Method |
|-----------|----------|--------|
| Create tag | `POST /api/v3/components/{component_ref}/tags` | POST |
| Get tag | `GET /api/v3/components/{component_ref}/tags/{tag_name}` | GET |
| List tags | `GET /api/v3/components/{component_ref}/tags` | GET |
| Delete tag | `DELETE /api/v3/components/{component_ref}/tags/{tag_name}` | DELETE |

Tags are **mutable** (can be moved to different versions). Aliases are **immutable**.

### 3.6 Search / Discovery
| Operation | Endpoint | Method |
|-----------|----------|--------|
| Search by External ID | `GET /api/v3/search/byExternalId` | GET |
| Global search (RFC) | Proposed cross-component search for artifacts/versions | - |

**Source**: [RFC: global search endpoint support](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/MLP/pages/5144269731), [external id to component versions](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/MLP/pages/6269719973)

### 3.7 Generic Permission Endpoints (Proposed)
| Operation | Endpoint | Method |
|-----------|----------|--------|
| Get permissions | `GET /api/v3/permissions/{entity_ref}` | GET |
| Set permissions | `PUT /api/v3/permissions/{entity_ref}` | PUT |

**Source**: [RFC: generic permission API endpoints](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/MLP/pages/5090911379)

