## 10. Component Types & Schemas

| Component Type | Type Name | Artifacts | Mandatory Metadata |
|---------------|-----------|-----------|-------------------|
| SageMaker Package | `sagemaker-package` | `model.tar.gz` + `sagemaker_package.json` | N/A |
| Model (TeamServe) | `model` | Multiple unzipped files (model.py, config.pbtxt, model.json) | Container args |
| Prompt | `prompt` | `prompt.json` or similar | Model metadata |
| Dataset | `dataset` | Data files | Schema, catalog refs |
| Legacy V2 | `tarot-v2` | Single tar.gz | userMetadata, tectonFeatures, SOX status |

**Validators on version create** (for `sagemaker-package`):
- `sagemaker_package.json` must exist in artifact list
- Must conform to JSON schema (packages array of `.tar.gz` filenames)
- Each referenced artifact must exist in the component

**Source**: [Component Specs](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/MLP/pages/4629793961), [ML Registry - Tarot v2 API compatibility](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/MLP/pages/4345902257)

