## 9. CLI (`atlas ml registry`)

```bash
# Create namespace
atlas ml registry namespace create \
  --name experiments \
  --namespace search-relevance \
  --description "Namespace for experiments" \
  --owner search-team-ad-group-name

# Create component
atlas ml registry component create \
  --name rankerModel \
  --namespace search-relevance \
  --description "A new ranker" \
  --owner search-team-ad-group-name \
  --type model

# Add permissions
atlas ml registry permission add write \
  --reference search-relevance.rankerModel \
  --ml-studio search_relevance \
  -g search-team-ad-group-name \
  --asap ml-studio/search_relevance/released
```

**Source**: [SSS-2360 L2 packaging using Tarot v3](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/~7120201ddfffba6aec4290997f86108f193ad4/pages/6434274411), [Register Model to V3](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/~712020b6830f7a4a054b87a3b33043eabe52a3/pages/6827544339)

