## 10. Component Types & Schemas

| Component Type | Type Name | Artifacts | Mandatory Metadata |
|---------------|-----------|-----------|-------------------|
| SageMaker Package | `sagemaker-package` | `model.tar.gz` + `sagemaker_package.json` | N/A |
| Model (TeamServe) | `model` | Multiple unzipped files (model.py, config.pbtxt, model.json) | Container args |
| Prompt | `prompt` | `prompt.json` or similar | Model metadata |
| Dataset | `dataset` | Data files | Schema, catalog refs |
| Legacy V2 | `tarot-v2` | Single tar.gz | userMetadata, tectonFeatures, SOX status |

**Validators on version create** (for `sagemaker-package`):
- `sagemaker_package.json` must exist in artifact list
- Must conform to JSON schema (packages array of `.tar.gz` filenames)
- Each referenced artifact must exist in the component

**Source**: [Component Specs](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/MLP/pages/4629793961), [ML Registry - Tarot v2 API compatibility](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/MLP/pages/4345902257)

---

## 11. Architecture & Infrastructure

| Layer | Technology |
|-------|-----------|
| API Layer | Kotlin + Spring Boot, RESTful, SLAuth auth, POCO authorization |
| Metadata Store | PostgreSQL (namespaces, components, versions, tags, permissions) |
| Legacy Metadata | DynamoDB (v2 model groups, versions) |
| Artifact Storage | TDP Object Store (UGC), dedicated S3 (legacy/non-UGC) |
| Events | StreamHub (lifecycle notifications, DMP integration) |
| Lineage | Dreamcatcher graph service |
| Indexing | Catalogue Data Search Service |

**Environments**:
- Production: `tarot.prod.services.atlassian.com` (inferred from URL patterns)
- Staging: accessible via `use_staging()` in SDK

**Source**: [CMK Assessment: Tarot (ML Registry Service)](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/entcap/pages/6054216041)

---

## 12. Client Libraries & Access Patterns

| Client/Wrapper | Actual API Called |
|---------------|-----------------|
| `atlas slauth curl` | v2 package upload OR v3 PUT |
| `atlassian-msp-sdk` Python (≥0.8) | v3 PUT |
| Bitbucket pipe (`register-model`) | v3 via SDK |
| ML Studio `ml_registry_register_mlflow` | v3 PUT (MLflow → Tarot import) |
| ML Studio `ml_registry_import_huggingface` | v3 PUT (HF Hub import) |
| ML Studio `ml_registry_migrate_model` | Reads v2, writes v3 |
| `atlas ml registry` CLI (beta) | v3 (namespace/component/permissions) |
| ML Registry UI | Browse-only |
| Deployment Store Client | `POST /api/v3/replicate` (reference-only) |

**Source**: [Tarot Model Ingress Paths](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/~712020f42e6ad0a6ee44319b956587ec99b127/pages/6974673626)

