   Confluence ADF.
 3 bitbucketPipeline.run + switcheroo gate is today's closest analogue to
   canary deploy.
 4 Symphony 3-tier autonomy is approximated by AGENTS.md proactivity rules
   (reads = 🟢, writes = 🟡); 🔴 escalation has no tooling.

                                 Bottom line


The MCP estate today is an Atlassian knowledge + SDLC layer. The AI MLE role
requires building the entire ML-platform abstraction (training, registry,
features, observability, serving, eval, policy) on top. Reference docs from
§11.2 + §4.1 (ML Runbook template, Launch Review Checklist, RFC-002,
