1. **Unblocking/migration rates** — what % of workloads migrate per quarter
2. **Cost unit economics** — $/GPU-hour on old vs. new platform
3. **Utilization assumptions** — expected efficiency gains
4. **Growth rates** — workload volume growth over forecast period
5. **Dual-run duration** — how long both systems run concurrently
6. **FTE reallocation** — engineer time freed up

