### 2. Tecton Feature Store — API Surface

#### Architecture
- **Platform**: Third-party managed (Tecton Inc.)
- **Online Store**: DynamoDB (multi-region: us-west-2, eu-west-1, eu-central-1, ap-northeast-1, ap-southeast-1, ap-southeast-2, ap-south-1)
- **Offline Store**: S3/Delta Lake (Databricks)
- **Auth**: Tecton API key + workspace credentials
