                                 Key Findings

                       MCP toolset coverage (existing)

 • Only one local SKILL.md exists (twg). All other capabilities (atlassian,
   bitbucket, compass, switcheroo, teamwork_graph, socrates, rovodev, s360,
   slack, etc.) are MCP toolsets discovered via get_tool_schema.
 • No existing MCP tool returns dollar cost figures directly. A new MLE cost
   skill must wrap Socrates SQL + the (in-design) AI Cost API.
 • s360 is sales-side — irrelevant to AI infra FinOps.
 • atlassian, bitbucket, compass, teamwork_graph, slack, socrates cover the
   composable surfaces (read/write Confluence/Jira, PR + pipeline reads,
   owner/on-call lookup, cross-product context, SQL).

                 Canonical Atlassian FinOps stack discovered

 • FinOps Portal at https://finops.internal.atlassian.com/; back-end repos
   finops-portal, finops-service-mimeo; CFINOPS Confluence space.
 • AI Cost API — Design Document (CFINOPS page 7045396956): future GET 
   /ai-costs in finops-service with period→periods[]→costs[] DTO. Not yet
   shipped.
 • Canonical Socrates cost tables (from "AI Training – Plato Cost" page
   7049098966):
    • production.cloud_finops_aws_cur.aws_focus_billing_data (AWS CUR)
    • production.analytics_platform_cost.databricks_costs (Databricks)
 • FinOps Bitbucket project (key CF): cloud-finops-aws-cur,
   cloud-finops-databricks, cloud-finops-data-signalfx,
   cloud-finops-ias(-data-product), finops-cats (Cost Attribution Tagging
   System) + variants, finops-fedramp-exporter, cloud-finops-terraform,
   finops-docs.
 • S2S contract: FinOps Software - S2S APIs page 7052735968 exposes GET 
