### 7. TEAMServe Integration with AI Gateway

**What it is**: AI Gateway routes requests to TEAMServe models using model registry configuration.

**How it works**:
```bash
# Update model ID when TEAMServe redeploys
curl --location --request PUT '<mlp-config-url>' \
  --header "Authorization: SLAUTH $(atlas slauth token -a mlp-config --groups=micros-sv--ai-gateway-dl-admins -e prod)" \
  --data '{
    "id": "gpt-oss-120b-ts",
    "vendor": "TEAMSERVE",
    "specification": {
      "metadata": { "tsId": "gpt-oss-120b-202509301957" }
    }
  }'
```

**Source**: [HOWTO: Manage Teamserve Models in AI-Gateway](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/MLP/pages/5760588068)

