## Stream A (cont.): Micros Service Descriptor Schema

### 8. Micros Service Descriptor — Core Schema

**What it is**: A YAML file that declaratively defines the entire footprint of a Micros service — compute, resources, scaling, deployment strategy, and infrastructure.

**How it works**:

#### Minimum Valid Descriptor:
```yaml
organization: Engineering Services
notifications:
  email: jdoe@atlassian.com
links:
  healthcheck:
    uri: /healthcheck
  source:
    url: https://bitbucket.org/atlassian/my-service
compose:
  microservice:
    image: docker.atl-paas.net/atlassian/my-cool-service
    tag: 0.0.1
    ports:
      - 8080:8080
buildNumber: 0.0.1
```

#### Full Service Descriptor Structure:
```yaml
# Basic settings
name: <SERVICE_NAME>
description: Organization Management
organization: Engineering-Admin Experience
buildNumber: latest
externalAccess: false

# Compute/Container
compose:
  microservice:
    image: docker.atl-paas.net/atlassian/my-service
    tag: "${ARTIFACT_VERSION}"
    ports:
      - 8080:8080

# Tenant context
tenantContext:
  enabled: true

# Health/monitoring links
links:
  healthcheck:
    uri: /healthcheck
  deepcheck:
    uri: /deepcheck
  source:
    url: https://bitbucket.org/atlassian/my-service
  semanticCheck:
    dockerImage:
      name: docker.atl-paas.net/my-service/semantic-checktag: 1.0.0
    splitBy: [group1, group2]

# Scaling configuration
scaling:
  instance:
    - c5.large
  min: 2
  max: 20
  policies:
    scalingOut:
      adjustmentType: PercentChangeInCapacity
      scalingAdjustment: 20minAdjustmentMagnitude: 1scalingAdjustmentSteps:
        - lowerBound: 70
          scalingAdjustment: 20estimatedInstanceWarmup: 300scalingIn:
      adjustmentType: ChangeInCapacity
      scalingAdjustment: 1

# Deployment strategy
deployment:
  type: progressive# or "hot-swap" (deprecated)

# Resources (DynamoDB, SQS, Redis, etc.)
resources:
  - type: postgres-db
    name: db- type: redisx
    name: my-cache
  - type: sqs
    name: eventsattributes:
      SnsTopicSubscriptions:
        - name: my-subscription
          snsTopic: "{{resource service='my-service' type='sns-topic' name='my-topic' property='arn'}}"

# Service proxy / auth
serviceProxy:
  enabled: true

# External compute (KITT++ bridge)
externalCompute:
  securityGroups:
    - groupId: sg-0d466c274609e497b
      accountId: '123456789012'
  trustRelationshipConditions:
    - ouPath: o-rab3nm4fez/*/ou-6ypf-mhairnvs/*
      tags:
        service_name: my-kitt-service

# Environment overrides
environmentOverrides:
  staging:
    scaling:
      min: 1
      max: 5prod:
    scaling:
      min: 5
      max: 50
```

#### Schema Ownership Paths:
| Path | Owner |
|------|-------|
| `$.compute`, `$.compose`, `$.scaling` | Micros Compute Team |
| `$.network` | Core Networks & Automation |
| `$.resources.*.attributes` | Per resource type |
| `$.serviceProxy` | Service to service fabric |
| slauth/poco bits | CloudSec |
| Everything else | Micros Core Team |

#### Validation:
```shell
micros service:validate my-service-name.sd.yml
# OR
atlas micros service deploy --service=$service-name --env=$env -f service-descriptor.yml
```

JSON Schema available at: `go/sdr` (internal link)

**Source**: [Service descriptor reference](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/MICROS/pages/167213240), [Copy of Service Descriptor Reference](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/~amacheret/pages/564399850), [Service Descriptor & Micros Resources Reference](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/ITSOL/pages/6976867502)

