## 10. Use Case Onboarding Process

1. **Register via Service Desk** — Raise ticket at `go/mldesk`
2. **Privacy/Legal Review** — Mandatory before production traffic
3. **Get Use Case ID** — Unique string (e.g., `confluence-widgets`)
4. **Configure Rate Limits** — Default100k TPM, customizable
5. **Register in MLP Config** — Via API POST to `/api/ai-gateway/model`
6. **Test in Staging** — Using staging base URL
7. **Production Rollout** — With kill-switch/feature flagging

**Compass Component Registration** required for formal onboarding (4-step V4 form).

**Source**: [AI Gateway Consumer Contract](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/agd/pages/5796071530), [HOWTO: Onboard a new model in AI Gateway](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/MLP/pages/5347485902)

