## 13. GCP ↔ Bedrock Cross-Cloud Routing

**Decision**: Use **Static Routing Override** (Option B) — AI Gateway rewrites Bedrock model IDs to Vertex equivalents when running on GCP:
- `anthropic.claude-sonnet-4-20250514-v1:0` → `claude-sonnet-4@20250514` on Vertex
- AWS tenants route to Bedrock as-is
- Non-cross-cloud models (Nova, Llama, Cohere) cannot be served in-cloud on GCP

**Source**: [LDR: AI Gateway GCP <> Bedrock Model Routing Strategy](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/MLP/pages/6972084078)

