## Summary: Critical Facts for Tool/Skill Implementation

1. **All LLM calls MUST go through AI Gateway** — no direct provider calls
2. **Use Case ID is mandatory** — register at `go/mldesk` before any calls
3. **V2 Unified API** (`POST /v2/chat`) is the recommended path for new workloads — model-agnostic, supports fallback
4. **V1 is NOT deprecated** — still primary for most existing services (~739 call sites)
5. **SLO-based routing** (tier+capability) is the future state — caller declares quality need, gateway resolves model
6. **Circuit breaker is per-instance** — global protection via distributed Redis is planned
7. **Default rate limit is 100k TPM** per use case per model — request increases via `#help-ml-platform`
8. **Fallback is automatic** but opt-outable via `X-Atlassian-Fallback-Strategy: NONE`
9. **Model IDs differ across vendors** — Bedrock uses `anthropic.claude-sonnet-4-20250514-v1:0`, Vertex uses `claude-sonnet-4@20250514`
10. **204 models across 7 vendors** in production, with automated lifecycle management being built

