{
  "id": "anthropic.claude-sonnet-4-6",
  "vendor": "BEDROCK",
  "category": "LLM",
  "family": "claude-family",
  "tiers": {
    "SHARED": {
      "pricing": {
        "TEXT": [
          {"type": "INPUT", "cost": 3.0, "scale": "PER_MILLION_TOKENS", "currency": "DOLLARS"},
          {"type": "OUTPUT", "cost": 15.0, "scale": "PER_MILLION_TOKENS", "currency": "DOLLARS"}
        ]
      }
    }
  },
  "availability": {
    "lifecycle": {"stage": "CRITICAL"},
    "regions": ["us-east-1"],
    "fallback": {},
    "crossRegionInference": true
  },
  "specification": {
    "inputModality": ["TEXT"],
    "outputModality": ["TEXT"],
    "maxInputLength": 200000,
    "maxOutputLength": 8192
  },
  "tags": ["stage:critical", "vendor:bedrock", "family:claude-family", "category:llm"]
}
```

### 8.2 Model Lifecycle States

| State | Use | Access |
|-------|-----|--------|
| **CRITICAL** | External customer-serving production | External + internal |
| **ACTIVE** | Internal production (no external traffic) | Internal only |
| **BETA** | Internal experimentation | Internal experimenters |
| **ALPHA** | Confidential/EAP testing | Restricted |
| **DEPRECATED** | No longer offered | Not available |

