|----------|-----------|--------|
| OpenAI | GPT-5.x series, GPT-4.1, GPT-5-mini, o4-mini | OPENAI |
| Anthropic | Claude Opus 4.x, Claude Sonnet 4.x, Claude Haiku 4.5 | BEDROCK, GOOGLE |
| Google | Gemini 3 Pro, Gemini 3 Flash, Gemini 2.5 series | GOOGLE |
| Amazon | Nova Lite/Micro/Pro | BEDROCK |
| Meta | Llama 3.x series | BEDROCK, TEAMSERVE |
| Atlassian | GPT-OSS 20B/120B, Llama 3.3 70B | TEAMSERVE, MSP |

