## 14. Observability & Tracing

- **Splunk**: Request logs, rate limit events, fallback metrics
- **SignalFx/Databricks**: Cost dashboards, per-use-case attribution
- **Arize**: LLM tracing (request/response capture at provider boundary)
- **Response headers**: `X-Model-Used`, `X-Provider-Used`, `X-Routing-*` headers for routing explainability
- **Tome**: SLO views and reliability tracking
- Key metrics: TTFT (Time to First Token), TPS (Tokens Per Second), input/output token counts

**Source**: [AI Gateway: LLM Tracing as a Platform Capability](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/~712020f435e62f8b0944b59f3bd4c2d2bb26ed/pages/6714832393)

