## Summary: Tool Surface for Skill/Tool Specification

### Operations to expose:

1. **`launchpad.deploy_to_teamserve`** — Launch ephemeral GPU endpoint
2. **`launchpad.deploy_to_sagemaker`** — Launch SageMaker endpoint (legacy)
3. **`launchpad.get_status`** — Poll deployment status
4. **`launchpad.invoke`** — Send inference request
5. **`launchpad.update`** — Hot-swap model version
6. **`launchpad.destroy`** — Delete deployment
7. **`launchpad.extend_ttl`** — Extend time-to-live
8. **`launchpad.run_load_test`** — Trigger performance benchmark
9. **`launchpad.validate_launch`** — Run ML Studio launch validation module
10. **`launchpad.validate_loadtest`** — Run ML Studio load test validation module

### Gates to validate:

| Gate | Check | Enforcement |
|------|-------|-------------|
| Instance type allowlist | `g6e.xlarge`, `g5.2xlarge` | Reject at API |
| TTL bounds | Default 2hr, max configurable | Set at launch |
| Container allowlist | Approved Triton versions | Reject at API |
| Model registered in Tarot V3 | `component_ref` + `version_ref` exist | Pre-flight check |
| Single replica | No auto-scale params | Platform enforced |
| Auth (ASAP/Slauth) | Valid service identity | SDK handles |
| UGC compliance (prod only) | Model approved for customer data | Manual gate for prod |
| Launch validation pass | `ts_launch_validation` annotation | Workflow gate |
| Load test validation pass | `ts_lp_loadtest_validation` annotation | Workflow gate |

### Human confirmation required:
- Production promotion (raise TEAMServe onboarding ticket)
- Compliance package approval
- UGC data access decisions

### Autonomous execution safe:
- Deploy to Launchpad (dev environment)
- Poll status
- Invoke for testing
- Run validation modules
- Destroy endpoints
- Extend TTL within bounds

