## Finding 7: ML Registry (Tarot V3) Integration

### What it is
Launchpad integrates with Tarot V3 ML Registry for model artifact resolution, deployment tracking, and lineage.

### How it works

**Registry Operations in Deploy Flow:**
1. `resolve_deployment(component_ref, "teamserve", deployment_ref)` — Find deployment component
2. `create_deployment_version(...)` — Record new deployment version
3. `set_deployment_version_status(...)` — Update status (InService, Failed, etc.)
4. `retire_previous_deployment_version(...)` — Mark old version retired
5. `get_version_by_tag(...)` — Look up current version

**Deployment Descriptor (artifact stored per deployment version):**
```json
{
    "model_name": "8c3df51da5ae7e3d504fb28240d156a1-model",
    "endpoint_name": "8c3df51da5ae7e3d504fb28240d156a1",
    "endpoint_config_name": "8c3df51da5ae7e3d504fb28240d156a1-config",
    "container": "763104351884.dkr.ecr.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/huggingface-pytorch-inference:...",
    "instance": "ml.g5.2xlarge",
    "principal": "srobilliard",
    "deployment_type": "launchpad-sagemaker",
    "environment": "prod-east",
    "environment_variables": {},
    "artifact_url": "s3://micros--prod-east--msp-sagemaker-launchpad--model-artifacts/..."
}
```

**Deployment Namespace:** `ml-platform.deployment.launchpad` subdivided into `sagemaker` and `teamserve` deployment groups.

**Tarot V3 Registration Prerequisite:**
```bash
atlas ml registry namespace create \
  --name <my-teams-namespace> \
  --description "Team's namespace" \
  --owner<my-teams-ssam-group>

atlas ml registry permission add write \
  -r <namespace> --ml-studio<use-case> -g <group>
```

### How it applies
The tool must accept `component_ref` and `version_ref` as inputs — these are the canonical identifiers from Tarot V3 that resolve to model artifacts. The Deployment Store replicates artifacts to the appropriate S3 bucket for the target runtime.

### Source
- [Model Deployments Now in ML Registry & Lineage](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/MLP/blog/2026/01/15/6317041646)
- [Launchpad provider for Deployment Store](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/MLP/pages/5801575865)

