| C           | 0.885 ± 0.012            | **0.865**| 0.852       | ❌ 92ms    |
| D           | 0.915 ± 0.006            | 0.850       | **0.930**   | ✅ 42ms    |

Statistical significance (paired t-test vs baseline A):
- B vs A: p=0.002 ✅
- C vs A: p=0.34❌ (not significant)
- D vs A: p=0.01 ✅

