|--------|--------|--------|
| Runbook coverage | 100% of paging alerts have linked runbook | Bitbucket SRE Audit |
| Freshness | < 6 months since last review | CSRE standard |
| Maturity level | All at "Proactive" minimum | Engineering Maturity Model |
| AI-readability | 100% have AI Hints section | AI-Assisted On-Call WS1 |
| Template compliance | 100% follow standard template | Quality Gates |

